WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.199 --> 00:00:06.200
Hello everyone, and welcome to this introductory class on Twinmotion.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:12.839
My name is Amer Yassine, I'm an Unreal Engine and Twinmotion instructor, and I will be your host today.

3
00:00:12.839 --> 00:00:18.839
Today we look at Twinmotion. This is in fact part 2 of a 3-part class on Twinmotion.

4
00:00:18.839 --> 00:00:27.160
If you are new to Twinmotion and haven't acquired the basics yet, then you may want to first check out the introductory class entitled

5
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:31.160
Twinmotion Part 1, The Basics, before attending this one.

6
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:40.159
In this part 2 class, you learn about additional tools that give you more flexibility, from animation to productivity tools.

7
00:00:40.159 --> 00:00:47.350
You then dig into lighting and see what is on offer, especially with man-made lights to support night scenes.

8
00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:56.509
From there, you learn about media output, and how to set up still images, panoramas and videos to export to this.

9
00:00:56.509 --> 00:01:02.740
You also learn to export self-executable presentations that you can share with your clients and audience.

10
00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:07.739
With that, others can enjoy your work without needing to have Twinmotion installed.

11
00:01:07.739 --> 00:01:14.859
Finally, you learn to work in phases, which is capturing an animation of the phases of construction of your project.

12
00:01:14.859 --> 00:01:18.090
And so, if you're ready, let's dive in.
